00:16:35.891 --> 00:16:37.349
There's multiple
files in this app.

00:16:37.349 --> 00:16:39.629
And one of them was a CSS file.

00:16:39.629 --> 00:16:42.929
Another one is
this words.py file.

00:16:42.929 --> 00:16:47.549
So all the words are
defined in this Python file.

00:16:47.549 --> 00:16:49.949
And you can just import
that the way you normally

00:16:49.949 --> 00:16:52.569
would from in a Python script.

00:16:52.569 --> 00:16:53.789
So you'd say import words.

00:16:53.789 --> 00:16:57.749
And also, once again, most
